graph TD
    %% Define nodes with clear names
    Client[Client/Application]
    S3in[S3 Input Bucket]
    S3out[S3 Output Location]
    SageMakerAPI[SageMaker API]
    Queue[Request Queue]
    Endpoint[Async Inference Endpoint]
    SNS[Amazon SNS Topic]
    
    %% Setup phase
    Client -->|1. Create Model| SageMakerAPI
    Client -->|2. Create EndpointConfig| SageMakerAPI
    Client -->|3. Create Endpoint| SageMakerAPI
    Client -->|4. Configure AutoScaling| SageMakerAPI
    
    %% Request processing
    Client -->|5. Upload payload| S3in
    Client -->|6. InvokeEndpointAsync| SageMakerAPI
    SageMakerAPI -->|7. Queue request| Queue
    S3in -->|8. Provide input data| Queue
    Queue -->|9. Process request| Endpoint
    
    %% Results and notifications
    Endpoint -->|10. Store results| S3out
    Endpoint -->|11. Send notification| SNS
    SNS -->|12. Notify success/error| Client
    S3out -->|13. Retrieve results| Client
    
    %% Cleanup
    Client -->|14. Deregister scaling| SageMakerAPI
    Client -->|15. Delete Endpoint| SageMakerAPI